OL,3,ABurnham proposes plan to cut standing
OL,4,Acharges from gas bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has asked
OL,7,Fministers to develop a plan to remove
OL,8,Fstanding charges from gas bills.
OL,10,FThese are fixed daily fees that cover
OL,11,Fthe costs of connecting to a supply.
OL,12,FThey vary by region and households must
OL,13,Fstill pay them even when energy is not
OL,14,Fbeing used.
OL,16,FIndustry body Energy UK said whether
OL,17,Fthe proposed changes would make a
OL,18,Fdifference to bills would depend on how
OL,19,For where the charges were reallocated
OL,20,Fon the bill.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
