OL,3,ABurnham proposes plan to cut standing
OL,4,Acharges from gas bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut an influential research foundation
OL,7,Fargued it would be a progressive move
OL,8,Fthat would help those on low-incomes
OL,9,Fand knock #27 off a typical annual
OL,10,Fbill.
